    "en": {
      "trackName": "Riddly Watch",
      "description": "Riddly turns your Apple Watch into a mystery campaign played with your mind and your wrist.\n\nFollow an original story through 30 connected cases. Each mystery unfolds in three short phases: examine the clues, interpret haptic codes, and complete a challenge using movement or the Digital Crown.\n\nA STORY IN SIX CHAPTERS\n\nSolve each case to unlock the next and follow the story to its conclusion. Riddly includes 30 mysteries and 90 interactions created specifically for the app.\n\nA NEW CHALLENGE EVERY DAY\n\nThe Daily Mystery works offline. Build your streak, review the last 28 days, and unlock nine achievements. You can also schedule an optional local reminder at your preferred time.\n\nTHE WATCH IS PART OF THE PUZZLE\n\nFeel haptic patterns, turn the Digital Crown, and move your wrist. Every physical interaction includes an accessible alternative that awards the same score.\n\nBUILT FOR PRIVACY\n\nNo account is required. There are no ads, analytics, tracking, or third-party SDKs. Your progress and preferences remain on your Apple Watch.\n\nChapter 1 and the Daily Mystery are free. A single one-time purchase unlocks chapters 2–6. No subscriptions.\n\nRiddly is a standalone Apple Watch app requiring watchOS 11 or later.",
